<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasTechnique> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasTechnique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Tactic> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasTechnique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#AttackTechnique> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasTechnique> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a tactic to an offensive technique that serves that tactic's goal." .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasTechnique> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "hasTechnique" .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasWeakness
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasWeakness> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasWeakness> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasWeakness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stones#Vulnerability> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasWeakness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Weakness> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasWeakness> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a vulnerability to the weakness class it exploits or instantiates."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasWeakness> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "hasWeakness" .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasWeakness> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The range is a stonework:Weakness individual whose IRI is derived from the CWE identifier. The weakness individual may be populated by a separate CWE ingest."@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#membersOf
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#membersOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
